==English==
{{was wotd|2015|October|27}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|miscellanées|notext=1}}, from {{der|en|la|miscellanea}}, from {{m|la|miscellus||mixed}}, from {{m|la|misceō||to mix}}.

Related to [[miscellaneous]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/mɪˈsɛ.lə.ni/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈmɪ.səˌleɪ.ni/|/mɪˈsɛ.lə.ni/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|miscellanies}}

# [[miscellaneous|Miscellaneous]] items.
# A collection of writings on various [[subject]]s or [[topic]]s; an [[anthology]].

